WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.500
Your AI knows you.

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.300
Your work. Your interests. Your plans.

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:07.050
Now use that knowledge on your terms.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.050
Ask the assistant you already use

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.450
to put your context into a profile.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.000
Bring its reply into Attention.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:17.500
There you are.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.630
Your goals, your interests, what you already know.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.950
Check it. Change it.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.400
It’s yours to use.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.950
Then protect your data with a password.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.080
Now, back to the web.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:34.020
A first signal before you open a link.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.180
On the article, hover over the title for a closer look.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.100
Jump to passages that may add something for you

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.100
with the context around them.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.300
Choose what to read.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.000
On your terms.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:58.100
Not someone else’s algorithms.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.100
Attention.
